# Tests for New Behavior

When adding features or fixing non-trivial bugs:

- Add or update unit tests in `tests/` (follow existing layout and naming)
- Add integration tests when touching external services (Discord, S3, external APIs, etc.)
- Follow existing patterns in `conftest.py` and fixture usage

Tests keep regressions from creeping back in.
